OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few
OL,6,Fresidual outbreaks of rain at first
OL,7,Fwill soon clear eastwards, leaving a
OL,8,Fdry and clear night. Colder than last
OL,9,Fnight with mist and fog patches
OL,10,Fdeveloping by dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FAny early mist and fog
OL,13,Fpatches will soon clear to leave a
OL,14,Ffine and dry day with light winds and
OL,15,Fsunny spells. Feeling pleasantly warm
OL,16,Fthrough the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
